    "text": "<p>Match List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> with List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math>.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td>Sucrose</td>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo></math>Galactose and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo></math>Glucose</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td>Lactose</td>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo></math>Glucose and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo></math>Fructose</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td>Maltose</td>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo></math>Glucose and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo></math>Glucose</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
